  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/06/FWestiu-2014KidsUsOnda.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 338px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><a href=\"http://www.kidsandus.es/\" target=\"_blank\">Kids&amp;Us, la school of english en la plaza Corts Valencianes, 9 de Onda</a>, organiza las fun weeks del verano, los &uacute;ltimos d&iacute;a de junio y en julio. Previamente se ha realizado una story time en La Cassola y ha habido dos jornadas de puertas abiertas en esta escuela infantil de ingl&eacute;s.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kidsampusjuny14/img_3989.jpg\" alt=\"img_3989\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kidsampusjuny14/img_3990.jpg\" alt=\"img_3990\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kidsampusjuny14/img_3991.jpg\" alt=\"img_3991\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kidsampusjuny14/img_3992.jpg\" alt=\"img_3992\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kidsampusjuny14/img_3993.jpg\" alt=\"img_3993\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kidsampusjuny14/img_3994.jpg\" alt=\"img_3994\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kidsampusjuny14/img_3995.jpg\" alt=\"img_3995\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kidsampusjuny14/img_3996.jpg\" alt=\"img_3996\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb